  triage:closureNote "quality-mgr: verified against integrate/phase-AI head -- ReleaseVersion::parse() (lines 97-138 of protocol.rs) now uses custom validation logic for beta and version parts instead of semver::Version::parse().is_err(). The diagnostic-discarding pattern no longer exists; error messages are generated from custom validation. Stale occurrence from superseded branch feature/pAI-s23-crosshost-shared-write-path; closing to match current reality. (2026-07-26)" ;
  triage:branch "AI.23" ;
